// Cedar Commons HOA — canonical JSON, replaced 2026-08-09.
//
// Authored by the broadened `.agents/skills/loom-calendar-experience-authoring` Skill (sandboxed to
// docs/references + this community's product doc only, no access to any prior hand-authored version),
// then independently judged (Community JSON Migration Tracker §1c) and found to beat the earlier
// hand-authored fixture on every one of the 3 overlapping workflows — most importantly, the earlier
// version had TWO real, confirmed bugs this file does not have:
//   1. `locationOverlap` was placed inside `creationGuard` on the facility reservation, which never runs
//      (`creationGuard` is PROPOSED, not implemented — `_createInstanceValidated` runs zero guard checks).
//      Double-booking protection was silently a no-op. This file places it on the `confirm-reservation`
//      transition guard instead — the real, working placement (see guards.md §9, fixed 2026-08-09 to say
//      so inline after this exact mistake was found).
//   2. `hoa-export-evidence` fabricated `"checksum": "SHA-{id}"` and `hoa-dues-payment` fabricated a
//      `receiptId` — both AP-6 violations (checksum/integrity-hash generation and payment-receipt ID
//      generation are both ❌ Not implemented platform services, per platform-services.md). This file has
//      neither: `hoa-export-evidence` has no checksum field at all, and dues payment uses a plain
//      `receiptStatus` enum instead of a fabricated ID.
// The earlier hand-authored version is preserved for reference at
// Loom_Communities_Workflow_Engine_CedarCommonsHOA_Example.HAND-AUTHORED-BACKUP.jsonc.
//
// 3 real, independently-verified defects found during the judge pass were fixed before this file was
// written (not present in the Skill's raw output):
//   - The facility reservation declared a time field named `startTime`. The Calendar surface
//     (`part28_engine_native_calendar_surface.dart`) reads `instanceData['eventTime']` by hardcoded
//     literal name for both the displayed time label and day-position sorting — `startTime` would have
//     parsed and validated fine but silently rendered no time and sorted every reservation to midnight.
//     Renamed to `eventTime` throughout (schema, guards, formula, seed data).
//   - Three terminal states had no `renderBinding` at all, so instances in them would vanish from every
//     tab once reached: `hoa-member-document.archived`, `hoa-committee-decision.closed`,
//     `hoa-owner-notification.withdrawn`. Added a `summary` binding for each.
//   - `hoa-dues-payment`'s `record-payment-failure` transition only fired `from: ["due"]`, so a second
//     failed payment attempt (a real product-doc requirement) couldn't be recorded once already in
//     `failed`. Added `"failed"` to its `from` list.
//
// Archetype choice for `hoa-facility-reservation` — settled here, not left ambiguous: `event-rsvp`, not
// `equipment-loan` (the hand-authored version's choice). Verified this degrades safely with none of
// event-rsvp's RSVP-specific fields declared (no broken capacity meter, no empty attendee roster, no dead
// RSVP button — all three are conditionally rendered only when their backing fields/rows exist), and it
// gains the real Day/Week/Month Calendar views the product doc's "HOA calendar" surface actually asks for.
// `equipment-loan` has no calendar-tab integration. If this decision needs revisiting, do it once, here —
// two authoritative fixtures previously disagreed on this and that cost real re-litigation.
//
// Known, deliberate gaps (not fixed — the grammar genuinely cannot express these yet):
//   - `hoa-member-document.documentUrl` is `type:"url"`, `openMode:"choice"` — PROPOSED, not yet rendered
//     as tappable (CJM.2 implemented `openMode:"external"` only; `choice`/`embedded` need
//     `webview_flutter`, not yet a dependency). Parses and validates; will render as a plain fact pill
//     until that lands.
//   - `hoa-export-evidence` has no checksum/transfer/rollback (payment processing, ID generation, and
//     checksum/integrity-hash generation are all ❌ Not implemented platform services) and no `documents`
//     tab exists (the `tabId` enum is closed to `{admin, calendar, giving, home, marketplace, messages}`),
//     so the document/architectural-request workflows share `home` instead of a dedicated Documents tab.
//
// Validator status at merge time: {"status":"pass","errorCount":0,"warningCount":0,"findings":[]}
//
// Fix 2026-08-09 — role-resolution reachability audit (dead-button bug class): the validator's
// `no_render_binding_for_reachable_state` check confirms every state has *some* renderBinding, but
// cannot tell whether that binding's `role` can ever actually resolve for the persona a transition's
// own guard allows on that tab — because role resolution isn't in the grammar at all, it's decided
// per-tab by App Shell code (`part32_engine_native_list_surface.dart` /
// `part27_engine_native_binding_dispatcher.dart` / `part28_engine_native_calendar_surface.dart`).
// Confirmed mechanism: `admin` is the only tab that ever computes "receiver" (creator gets "actor",
// everyone else gets "receiver"); `giving`/`messages`/`home`/`marketplace` grant "actor" to the
// creator only and NOTHING otherwise (never "receiver"); `calendar` grants neither role, ever — only
// `role: "any"` bindings can render there. Five renderBindings in this file assumed "actor"/"receiver"
// would resolve for a business-logic role (the payer, the recipient, the case owner) that didn't match
// `createdByPersonaId`, making the state genuinely unreachable (dead button) or, in one case,
// permanently invisible (dead summary card) for the persona the transition/notice was written for.
// Fixed additively — no existing binding removed, no guard/transition/persona-list logic changed,
// each site commented inline with the specific reachability gap and why the given fix is correct:
//   - `hoa-dues-payment`: Giving tab's "actor" binding (due/failed) only ever matched hoa-board (the
//     charge's creator), never the paying hoa-member — `pay-dues` was a dead button. Widened to "any".
//   - `hoa-architectural-request`: Admin's receiver binding didn't cover approved/denied, so
//     `reopen-case` (board-only) was a dead button — expanded its `states`. Home's actor binding was
//     summary-only across 6 states, making `withdraw-request`/`attach-document` dead buttons for the
//     homeowner in submitted/under-review/reopened — split into a primary binding for those 3 states
//     (states with a real hoa-member-guarded transition) and left approved/denied/withdrawn summary
//     (no hoa-member transition ever targets them — correctly read-only per render-bindings.md).
//   - `hoa-committee-decision`: Home's "receiver" binding for `recorded` could never resolve for
//     either persona under the confirmed mechanism, so the homeowner's decision notice was permanently
//     invisible — widened to "any".
//   - `hoa-owner-notification`: Messages tab's "receiver" binding could never resolve (every notice is
//     board-created), so `mark-notice-read`/`mark-notice-unread` were dead buttons for the actual
//     recipient — widened to "any".
// Re-validated after these fixes: {"status":"pass","errorCount":0,"warningCount":0,"findings":[]}
// (unchanged from merge time — see the real run below for confirmation this stayed true).

{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "packageId": "init_cedar_commons_hoa_1",
  "communityId": "community_cedar_commons_hoa",
  "communityHandle": "cedar-commons-hoa",
  "displayName": "Cedar Commons HOA",
  "extensionId": "ext_cedar_commons_hoa",
  "branding": { "accentColor": "#1F4E79" },
  "seedDataFiles": [],
  "idempotencyKey": "init-cedar-commons-hoa-v1",

  "experience": {
    "experienceSchemaVersion": 2,
    "workflowGrammarVersion": 1,

    "displayName": "Cedar Commons HOA",
    "tagline": "Dues, documents, facilities, and board decisions for Cedar Commons homeowners.",
    "accentColor": "#1F4E79",

    "creatableAction": {
      "multiActionStyle": "speedDial",
      "presentationStyle": "slideOutBottom"
    },

    "personas": [
      {
        "personaId": "hoa-member",
        "label": "Homeowner",
        "roleLabel": "Homeowner",
        "description": "Pays dues, reads governing documents, reserves facilities, and submits architectural requests."
      },
      {
        "personaId": "hoa-board",
        "label": "Board",
        "roleLabel": "Board reviewer",
        "description": "Reviews architectural requests, records committee decisions, publishes documents and notices, and manages HOA record exports."
      }
    ],

    "workflowDefinitions": {

      // 1. hoa-dues-payment — paymentCheckout (🟡 GENERIC, real). due/failed/paid states match the
      // product doc exactly. receiptStatus is a plain enum, never a fabricated receipt id (AP-6).
      "hoa-dues-payment": {
        "initialState": "due",
        "visibility": { "default": "membersOnly" },
        "states": {
          "due": {
            "label": "Dues due",
            "tone": "warning",
            "editableFields": ["purpose", "amountDue", "dueDate", "payerPersonaId"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          "failed": { "label": "Payment failed", "tone": "negative" },
          "paid": { "label": "Paid", "tone": "positive", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "pay-dues",
            "label": "Pay dues",
            "icon": "payments_outlined",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["due", "failed"],
            "to": "paid",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "payerPersonaId" }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "paidAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "paidByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "receiptStatus", "value": "complete" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "record-payment-failure",
            "label": "Record failed payment",
            "icon": "error_outline",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["due", "failed"],
            "to": "failed",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "failureReason": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "receiptStatus", "value": "failed" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "failedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "failureReason", "value": "{input.failureReason}" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          // Fix 2026-08-09 (role-resolution reachability audit): was "role": "actor". The Giving
          // tab's actor/receiver resolution (part32_engine_native_list_surface.dart's
          // `_engineNativeActorRolesForInstance`, the App Shell default when a tab surface doesn't
          // pass its own `rolesForInstance`) grants "actor" only to `createdByPersonaId` — and every
          // dues charge is created by hoa-board (the tab's create-action is board-only), never by the
          // paying hoa-member. Under "role": "actor" the payer could never see this card at all, so
          // "pay-dues" (guard: hoa-member matching `payerPersonaId`) was a dead button for the one
          // persona actually meant to fire it. "any" is the only selector this tab's mechanism can
          // ever resolve for a non-creator; the transition's own guard still restricts who can
          // actually press Pay (board sees the card too, as before, but never the button).
          {
            "states": ["due", "failed"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "giving",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "paymentCheckout",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "New dues charge",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "states": ["paid"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "giving",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "paymentCheckout",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["due", "failed", "paid"],
            "role": "receiver",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "purpose": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "amountDue": {
            "type": "number", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "payments_outlined", "labelTemplate": "{value} USD",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "dueDate": {
            "type": "date", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "sortable": true, "displayIcon": "event", "labelTemplate": "Due {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "payerPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "Payer: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "paidAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "verified_outlined", "labelTemplate": "Paid {value}", "hideWhenEmpty": true,
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "paidByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "receiptStatus": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "receipt_long", "labelTemplate": "Receipt: {value}", "hideWhenEmpty": true,
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "failedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "error_outline", "labelTemplate": "Failed {value}", "hideWhenEmpty": true,
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "failureReason": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "report_gmailerrorred", "labelTemplate": "Reason: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "daysUntilDue": { "type": "number", "formula": "daysUntil(dueDate)", "displayContexts": [] },
          "isOverdue": { "type": "bool", "formula": "isPast(dueDate)", "displayContexts": [] }
        }
      },

      // 2. hoa-member-document — formEntry + type:"url" (documentUrl, openMode:"choice"), NOT
      // documentLibrary (❌ NOT REAL). Separate read/acknowledged/access-requested/granted-access
      // personaId[] lists, since these are per-member conditions (data), not per-instance states (AP-1).
      "hoa-member-document": {
        "initialState": "published",
        "visibility": { "default": "membersOnly" },
        "states": {
          "published": {
            "label": "Available",
            "tone": "positive",
            "editableFields": ["title", "version", "effectiveDate", "summary", "sourceLabel", "documentUrl"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          "archived": { "label": "Superseded", "tone": "info", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "mark-read",
            "label": "Mark as read",
            "icon": "visibility",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
              "actorInList": { "key": "readPersonaIds", "present": false }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "appendUnique", "key": "readPersonaIds", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "mark-unread",
            "label": "Mark unread",
            "icon": "visibility_off",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
              "actorInList": { "key": "readPersonaIds", "present": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "removeValue", "key": "readPersonaIds", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "acknowledge-document",
            "label": "Acknowledge",
            "icon": "task_alt",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
              "actorInList": { "key": "acknowledgedPersonaIds", "present": false }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "appendUnique", "key": "acknowledgedPersonaIds", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "appendUnique", "key": "readPersonaIds", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "request-access",
            "label": "Request access",
            "icon": "lock_open",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorInList": { "key": "accessRequestedPersonaIds", "present": false }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "appendUnique", "key": "accessRequestedPersonaIds", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "grant-access",
            "label": "Grant access",
            "icon": "verified_user",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "granteePersonaId": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "appendUnique", "key": "grantedAccessPersonaIds", "value": "{input.granteePersonaId}" },
              { "op": "removeValue", "key": "accessRequestedPersonaIds", "value": "{input.granteePersonaId}" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "archive-document",
            "label": "Supersede document",
            "icon": "inventory",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["published"],
            "to": "archived",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "archivedAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["published"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "Publish document",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "states": ["archived"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "title": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "sortable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "bookmark_border", "labelTemplate": "Version {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "effectiveDate": {
            "type": "date", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "sortable": true, "displayIcon": "event_note", "labelTemplate": "Effective {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "summary": {
            "type": "textarea", "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline", "maxLength": 500,
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "sourceLabel": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "corporate_fare", "labelTemplate": "Source: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "documentUrl": {
            "type": "url", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "openMode": "choice", "displayIcon": "description", "labelTemplate": "Open {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },

          "readPersonaIds": {
            "type": "personaId[]", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "visibility", "labelTemplate": "Read by {value.length}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "acknowledgedPersonaIds": {
            "type": "personaId[]", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "task_alt", "labelTemplate": "Acknowledged: {value.length}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "accessRequestedPersonaIds": {
            "type": "personaId[]", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "pending_actions", "labelTemplate": "Access requests: {value.length}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "grantedAccessPersonaIds": {
            "type": "personaId[]", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "verified_user", "labelTemplate": "Download access: {value.length}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "archivedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },

          "acknowledgementCount": {
            "type": "number", "formula": "size(acknowledgedPersonaIds)", "displayContexts": []
          },
          "isAcknowledgedByViewer": {
            "type": "bool", "formula": "contains(acknowledgedPersonaIds, $viewer)", "displayContexts": []
          },
          "viewerMayDownload": {
            "type": "bool", "formula": "contains(grantedAccessPersonaIds, $viewer)", "displayContexts": []
          }
        }
      },

      // 3. hoa-facility-reservation — event-rsvp (see file-header note on why, not equipment-loan).
      // eventTime (NOT startTime — Calendar reads this literal field name) drives the tile time label
      // and day-position sort. locationOverlap lives on confirm-reservation's transition guard, the real
      // working placement (never creationGuard — see guards.md §9's now-inline caveat).
      "hoa-facility-reservation": {
        "initialState": "requested",
        "visibility": { "default": "membersOnly" },
        "states": {
          "requested": {
            "label": "Requested",
            "tone": "info",
            "editableFields": ["title", "facility", "eventDate", "eventTime", "endTime", "purpose", "reservedByPersonaId"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"] }
          },
          "reserved": { "label": "Reserved", "tone": "positive" },
          "cancelled": { "label": "Cancelled", "tone": "negative", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "confirm-reservation",
            "label": "Reserve facility",
            "icon": "event_available",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["requested"],
            "to": "reserved",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
              "locationOverlap": {
                "locationField": "facility",
                "dateField": "eventDate",
                "timeField": "eventTime",
                "durationMinutes": 120
              }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "confirmedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "confirmedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "request-change",
            "label": "Change reservation",
            "icon": "edit_calendar",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["reserved"],
            "to": "requested",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "reservedByPersonaId" }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "confirmedAt", "value": null },
              { "op": "set", "key": "confirmedByPersonaId", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "set-reminder",
            "label": "Add reminder",
            "icon": "notifications_active",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["requested", "reserved"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "reservedByPersonaId" }
            },
            "inputs": {
              "offsetHours": { "type": "number", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "reminderOffsetHours", "value": "{input.offsetHours}" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "reminderSetAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "cancel-reservation",
            "label": "Cancel reservation",
            "icon": "event_busy",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["requested", "reserved"],
            "to": "cancelled",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "reservedByPersonaId" },
              "cancellationDeadline": {
                "dateField": "eventDate",
                "timeField": "eventTime",
                "hoursBefore": 24
              }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "cancelledAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "board-cancel-reservation",
            "label": "Cancel (board)",
            "icon": "block",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["requested", "reserved"],
            "to": "cancelled",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "cancellationNote": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "cancelledAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "cancellationNote", "value": "{input.cancellationNote}" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["requested"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "calendar",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "event-rsvp",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "New reservation",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "states": ["reserved"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "calendar",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "event-rsvp",
            "bindingKind": "primary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["cancelled"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "calendar",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "event-rsvp",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["requested", "reserved"],
            "role": "receiver",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "title": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "facility": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "meeting_room", "labelTemplate": "{value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "eventDate": {
            "type": "date", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "sortable": true, "displayIcon": "calendar_today", "labelTemplate": "{value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "eventTime": {
            "type": "time", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "schedule", "labelTemplate": "From {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "endTime": {
            "type": "time", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "timelapse", "labelTemplate": "Until {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "purpose": {
            "type": "textarea", "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline", "maxLength": 300,
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "reservedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "Reserved by {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "confirmedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "check_circle_outline", "labelTemplate": "Confirmed {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "confirmedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "cancelledAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "event_busy", "labelTemplate": "Cancelled {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "cancellationNote": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "sticky_note_2", "labelTemplate": "Note: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "reminderOffsetHours": {
            "type": "number", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "displayContexts": []
          },
          "reminderSetAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "notifications_active", "labelTemplate": "Reminder set {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "reminderAt": {
            "type": "date",
            "formula": "subtractHours(combineDateAndTime(eventDate, eventTime), if(reminderOffsetHours == null, 24, reminderOffsetHours))",
            "displayIcon": "alarm", "labelTemplate": "Reminder {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "daysUntilReservation": {
            "type": "number", "formula": "daysUntil(eventDate)", "displayContexts": []
          },
          "hasStarted": { "type": "bool", "formula": "isPast(eventDate)", "displayContexts": [] }
        }
      },

      // 4. hoa-architectural-request — formEntry (author) / statusTimeline (actor summary) /
      // approvalQueueItem (board receiver). Payment checkpoint is a real, engine-enforced
      // requiresWorkflowsComplete guard on submit-request, not a display-only claim. Creates a
      // hoa-committee-decision instance via an instance-scoped create action on the board's queue row.
      "hoa-architectural-request": {
        "initialState": "draft",
        "visibility": { "default": "membersOnly" },
        "states": {
          "draft": {
            "label": "Draft",
            "tone": "info",
            "editableFields": ["title", "changeDescription", "propertyAddress", "requestedByPersonaId", "estimatedStartDate"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"] }
          },
          "submitted": { "label": "Submitted", "tone": "info" },
          "under-review": { "label": "Under review", "tone": "info" },
          "changes-needed": {
            "label": "Changes requested",
            "tone": "warning",
            "editableFields": ["title", "changeDescription", "propertyAddress", "estimatedStartDate"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"] }
          },
          "reopened": { "label": "Reopened", "tone": "warning" },
          "approved": { "label": "Approved", "tone": "positive" },
          "denied": { "label": "Denied", "tone": "negative" },
          "withdrawn": { "label": "Withdrawn", "tone": "negative", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "submit-request",
            "label": "Submit request",
            "icon": "send",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["draft", "changes-needed"],
            "to": "submitted",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "requestedByPersonaId" },
              "requiresWorkflowsComplete": ["hoa-dues-payment"]
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "submittedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "begin-review",
            "label": "Start review",
            "icon": "rate_review",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["submitted"],
            "to": "under-review",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "reviewerPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "reviewStartedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "request-changes",
            "label": "Request changes",
            "icon": "undo",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["submitted", "under-review"],
            "to": "changes-needed",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "note": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "append", "key": "reviewNotes",
                "value": { "author": "$actor", "note": "{input.note}", "timestamp": "$timestamp" }
              },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "approve-request",
            "label": "Approve request",
            "icon": "check_circle",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["under-review", "reopened"],
            "to": "approved",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "decidedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "decidedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "deny-request",
            "label": "Deny request",
            "icon": "cancel",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["under-review", "reopened"],
            "to": "denied",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "note": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "decidedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "decidedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              {
                "op": "append", "key": "reviewNotes",
                "value": { "author": "$actor", "note": "{input.note}", "timestamp": "$timestamp" }
              },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "reopen-case",
            "label": "Reopen case",
            "icon": "restart_alt",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["approved", "denied"],
            "to": "reopened",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "note": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "append", "key": "reviewNotes",
                "value": { "author": "$actor", "note": "{input.note}", "timestamp": "$timestamp" }
              },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "resume-review",
            "label": "Resume review",
            "icon": "play_arrow",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["reopened"],
            "to": "under-review",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "reviewerPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "attach-document",
            "label": "Attach document",
            "icon": "attach_file",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["draft", "submitted", "under-review", "changes-needed", "reopened"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member", "hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "documentLabel": { "type": "text", "required": true },
              "documentUrl": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "append", "key": "supportingDocuments",
                "value": {
                  "label": "{input.documentLabel}",
                  "source": "{input.documentUrl}",
                  "addedBy": "$actor",
                  "addedAt": "$timestamp"
                }
              },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "withdraw-request",
            "label": "Withdraw request",
            "icon": "delete_outline",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["draft", "submitted", "under-review", "changes-needed"],
            "to": "withdrawn",
            "guard": {
              "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
              "actorEqualsField": { "key": "requestedByPersonaId" }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastActivityAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["draft", "changes-needed"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "New architectural request",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-member"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          // Fix 2026-08-09 (role-resolution reachability audit): this single 6-state binding was
          // "bindingKind": "summary" (no action row) for all of them. Split into two, additively —
          // no existing states removed, only re-partitioned by whether hoa-member (always this
          // type's creator, so always "actor" on Home — home_tab role resolution is creator-match
          // only, see part32_engine_native_list_surface.dart's `_engineNativeActorRolesForInstance`)
          // has a real transition to fire from that state:
          //   - "withdraw-request" (guard: hoa-member/requestedByPersonaId) fires `from` including
          //     "submitted"/"under-review" — summary-only made it a dead button there.
          //   - "attach-document" (guard: hoa-member OR hoa-board) fires `from` including
          //     "submitted"/"under-review"/"reopened" — same dead-button problem for hoa-member.
          // "approved"/"denied"/"withdrawn" have no hoa-member-guarded transition at all (the
          // homeowner only ever observes a final decision), so they correctly stay "summary" per
          // render-bindings.md's own guidance ("primary for the state where the user acts; summary
          // for states where they only observe").
          {
            "states": ["submitted", "under-review", "reopened"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "primary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["approved", "denied", "withdrawn"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          },
          // Fix 2026-08-09 (role-resolution reachability audit): "states" was
          // ["submitted", "under-review", "reopened"] only. "reopen-case" (guard: hoa-board only)
          // fires `from: ["approved", "denied"]`, but neither state was covered by any admin-tab
          // binding, so it was a dead button for the board — expanded (additive) to include them.
          // The Home actor-summary binding below already covers approved/denied for the homeowner's
          // own read-only view; this is the board's corresponding queue view.
          {
            "states": ["submitted", "under-review", "reopened", "approved", "denied"],
            "role": "receiver",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "approvalQueueItem",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "workflowType": "hoa-committee-decision",
                "label": "Open committee deliberation",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"],
                "scope": "instance",
                "presentation": "button",
                "prefill": { "requestId": "{context.id}", "subject": "{context.title}" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "title": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "changeDescription": {
            "type": "textarea", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "maxLength": 800, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "propertyAddress": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "home_work", "labelTemplate": "{value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "requestedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "Requester: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "estimatedStartDate": {
            "type": "date", "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "sortable": true, "displayIcon": "event", "labelTemplate": "Planned start {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "submittedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "sortable": true,
            "displayIcon": "send", "labelTemplate": "Submitted {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "reviewerPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "gavel", "labelTemplate": "Reviewer: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "reviewStartedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "decidedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "how_to_reg", "labelTemplate": "Decided by {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "decidedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "event_available", "labelTemplate": "Decided {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "reviewNotes": {
            "type": "list", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "comment", "labelTemplate": "{value.length} review notes",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "supportingDocuments": {
            "type": "list", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "itemSchema": {
              "label": { "type": "text", "labelTemplate": "{value}" },
              "source": { "type": "url", "openMode": "external", "labelTemplate": "{value}" },
              "addedBy": { "type": "text", "labelTemplate": "Added by {value}" },
              "addedAt": { "type": "text", "labelTemplate": "Added {value}" }
            },
            "displayIcon": "attach_file", "labelTemplate": "{value.length} attachments",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "committeeNotes": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "fact_check", "labelTemplate": "Committee minutes: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "committeeDecisionRecordedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "lastActivityAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "sortable": true,
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },

          "noteCount": { "type": "number", "formula": "size(reviewNotes)", "displayContexts": [] },
          "attachmentCount": { "type": "number", "formula": "size(supportingDocuments)", "displayContexts": [] },
          "hasCommitteeMinutes": {
            "type": "bool", "formula": "if(committeeNotes == null, false, true)", "displayContexts": []
          }
        }
      },

      // 5. hoa-committee-decision — discussionThread (open) / statusTimeline (recorded/closed). A
      // separate type from hoa-architectural-request, not duplication (AP-7): the request is the case
      // lifecycle, this is the committee's deliberation record. record-decision writes back onto the
      // linked request via relatedInstance + spawns a draft hoa-owner-notification. Board-only visibility
      // (guarded readGuard) except a per-state readGuard override on `recorded` that opens it to the
      // homeowner once minuted — the documented mechanism for "board-only while deliberating, visible once
      // decided" (workflow-grammar.md's visibility/readGuard section).
      "hoa-committee-decision": {
        "initialState": "open",
        "visibility": {
          "default": "guarded",
          "readGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
        },
        "states": {
          "open": {
            "label": "In deliberation",
            "tone": "info",
            "editableFields": ["subject"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          "recorded": {
            "label": "Decision recorded",
            "tone": "positive",
            "readGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board", "hoa-member"] }
          },
          "closed": { "label": "Closed", "tone": "info", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "post-comment",
            "label": "Add comment",
            "icon": "add_comment",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["open"],
            "to": null,
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "comment": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              {
                "op": "append", "key": "comments",
                "value": { "author": "$actor", "body": "{input.comment}", "timestamp": "$timestamp" }
              },
              { "op": "set", "key": "lastCommentAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "record-decision",
            "label": "Record decision",
            "icon": "gavel",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["open"],
            "to": "recorded",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "inputs": {
              "outcome": {
                "type": "text",
                "required": true,
                "options": ["approved", "denied", "changes-requested"]
              },
              "minutes": { "type": "text", "required": true },
              "ownerPersonaId": { "type": "text", "required": true }
            },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "decisionOutcome", "value": "{input.outcome}" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "minutes", "value": "{input.minutes}" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "recordedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "recordedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              {
                "op": "set", "key": "committeeNotes", "value": "{input.minutes}",
                "relatedInstance": "requestId"
              },
              {
                "op": "set", "key": "committeeDecisionRecordedAt", "value": "$timestamp",
                "relatedInstance": "requestId"
              },
              {
                "op": "createInstance",
                "workflowType": "hoa-owner-notification",
                "fields": {
                  "subject": "Committee decision recorded",
                  "body": "{input.minutes}",
                  "recipientPersonaId": "{input.ownerPersonaId}",
                  "audienceLabel": "Requesting homeowner",
                  "relatedRequestId": "{requestId}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "reopen-deliberation",
            "label": "Reopen deliberation",
            "icon": "restart_alt",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["recorded"],
            "to": "open",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          {
            "id": "close-deliberation",
            "label": "Close deliberation",
            "icon": "archive",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["open", "recorded"],
            "to": "closed",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["open"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "discussionThread",
            "bindingKind": "primary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["recorded"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "primary"
          },
          // Fix 2026-08-09 (role-resolution reachability audit): was "role": "receiver". Home tab's
          // resolution (same `_engineNativeActorRolesForInstance` creator-match-only mechanism as
          // Giving/Messages — see part32_engine_native_list_surface.dart) never grants "receiver" to
          // anyone; it only ever grants "actor" to `createdByPersonaId`, always hoa-board for this
          // type. So this binding could never resolve for either persona — hoa-board gets "actor"
          // (no binding declares that role on Home for this state), hoa-member gets nothing (never
          // the creator). The requesting homeowner would never see their own decision notice.
          // Widened to "any" (no other Home binding covers "recorded" for this type, so no duplicate
          // card risk); the guard on this type's transitions is unaffected — hoa-member has no
          // guarded transition here anyway, this is a read-only notice.
          {
            "states": ["recorded"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "home",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["closed"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "requestId": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "storage": "inline", "displayContexts": []
          },
          "subject": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },

          "comments": {
            "type": "list", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "forum", "labelTemplate": "{value.length} comments",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "lastCommentAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "sortable": true,
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "decisionOutcome": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "gavel", "labelTemplate": "Decision: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "minutes": {
            "type": "textarea", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "description", "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "recordedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "Recorded by {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "recordedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "event_available", "labelTemplate": "Recorded {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "commentCount": { "type": "number", "formula": "size(comments)", "displayContexts": [] },
          "isDecided": {
            "type": "bool", "formula": "if(decisionOutcome == null, false, true)", "displayContexts": []
          }
        }
      },

      // 6. hoa-owner-notification — notificationInbox (real, sent/read receiver states) + formEntry for
      // the board's draft compose surface.
      "hoa-owner-notification": {
        "initialState": "draft",
        "visibility": { "default": "membersOnly" },
        "states": {
          "draft": {
            "label": "Draft notice",
            "tone": "info",
            "editableFields": ["subject", "body", "recipientPersonaId", "audienceLabel"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          "sent": { "label": "Sent", "tone": "positive" },
          "read": { "label": "Read", "tone": "info" },
          "withdrawn": { "label": "Withdrawn", "tone": "negative", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "send-notice",
            "label": "Send notice",
            "icon": "campaign",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["draft"],
            "to": "sent",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "senderPersonaId", "value": "$actor" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "sentAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "mark-notice-read",
            "label": "Mark read",
            "icon": "done",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["sent"],
            "to": "read",
            "guard": { "actorEqualsField": { "key": "recipientPersonaId" } },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "readAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "mark-notice-unread",
            "label": "Mark unread",
            "icon": "mark_email_unread",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["read"],
            "to": "sent",
            "guard": { "actorEqualsField": { "key": "recipientPersonaId" } },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "readAt", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "withdraw-notice",
            "label": "Withdraw notice",
            "icon": "delete_outline",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["draft"],
            "to": "withdrawn",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["draft"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "Compose owner notice",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          // Fix 2026-08-09 (role-resolution reachability audit): was "role": "receiver". Messages
          // tab's resolution is the same creator-match-only mechanism as Giving/Home (see
          // part32_engine_native_list_surface.dart's `_engineNativeActorRolesForInstance`) and never
          // grants "receiver" to anyone; every hoa-owner-notification instance is created by
          // hoa-board (the only persona allowed to send-notice / the only actor of the
          // `record-decision`-triggered createInstance effect), so the actual recipient
          // (`recipientPersonaId`, always hoa-member) could never see this binding at all — making
          // "mark-notice-read"/"mark-notice-unread" (guard: `actorEqualsField: recipientPersonaId`,
          // open to any persona) permanently dead buttons for the one persona meant to fire them.
          // Widened to "any" (no other Messages-tab binding exists for this type, so no duplicate
          // card risk); board now also sees their own sent notices on Messages, but the guard still
          // restricts the read/unread buttons to the actual recipient.
          {
            "states": ["sent", "read"],
            "role": "any",
            "tabId": "messages",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "notificationInbox",
            "bindingKind": "primary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["sent", "read"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "notificationInbox",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          },
          {
            "states": ["withdrawn"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "subject": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "body": {
            "type": "textarea", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "maxLength": 1000, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "recipientPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "To: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "audienceLabel": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "groups_outlined", "labelTemplate": "Audience: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },

          "senderPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "campaign", "labelTemplate": "From: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "sentAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "sortable": true,
            "displayIcon": "schedule", "labelTemplate": "Sent {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "readAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "mark_email_read", "labelTemplate": "Read {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "relatedRequestId": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },

          "isSent": { "type": "bool", "formula": "if(sentAt == null, false, true)", "displayContexts": [] }
        }
      },

      // 7. hoa-export-evidence — formEntry, NOT exportWizard (❌ NOT REAL). Deliberately has no checksum,
      // export-id, or transfer/rollback field or effect anywhere — checksum/integrity-hash generation and
      // ID generation are both ❌ Not implemented platform services (platform-services.md); fabricating a
      // plausible-looking value for either is AP-6. change-scope (clear the generation stamps, return to
      // scoping) is the honest subset of "rollback" that's actually expressible.
      "hoa-export-evidence": {
        "initialState": "scoping",
        "visibility": {
          "default": "guarded",
          "readGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
        },
        "states": {
          "scoping": {
            "label": "Scope selected",
            "tone": "info",
            "editableFields": ["scopeLabel", "recordTypes", "rangeStart", "rangeEnd", "redactionProfile", "requestedByPersonaId"],
            "editGuard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] }
          },
          "redaction-preview": { "label": "Redaction reviewed", "tone": "warning" },
          "generated": { "label": "Export generated", "tone": "positive" },
          "cancelled": { "label": "Cancelled", "tone": "negative", "isTerminal": true }
        },
        "transitions": [
          {
            "id": "preview-redaction",
            "label": "Preview redaction",
            "icon": "preview",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["scoping"],
            "to": "redaction-preview",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "redactionPreviewedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "redactionPreviewedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "generate-export",
            "label": "Generate export",
            "icon": "download_for_offline",
            "tone": "primary",
            "from": ["redaction-preview"],
            "to": "generated",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "generatedAt", "value": "$timestamp" },
              { "op": "set", "key": "generatedByPersonaId", "value": "$actor" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "change-scope",
            "label": "Change scope",
            "icon": "tune",
            "tone": "secondary",
            "from": ["redaction-preview", "generated"],
            "to": "scoping",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "redactionPreviewedAt", "value": null },
              { "op": "set", "key": "redactionPreviewedByPersonaId", "value": null },
              { "op": "set", "key": "generatedAt", "value": null },
              { "op": "set", "key": "generatedByPersonaId", "value": null }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "cancel-export",
            "label": "Cancel export",
            "icon": "block",
            "tone": "destructive",
            "from": ["scoping", "redaction-preview", "generated"],
            "to": "cancelled",
            "guard": { "allowedPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"] },
            "effects": [
              { "op": "set", "key": "cancelledAt", "value": "$timestamp" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "renderBindings": [
          {
            "states": ["scoping", "redaction-preview", "generated"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "formEntry",
            "bindingKind": "primary",
            "actions": [
              {
                "kind": "create",
                "label": "New record export",
                "byPersonaIds": ["hoa-board"],
                "scope": "tab",
                "presentation": "fab"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "states": ["cancelled"],
            "role": "actor",
            "tabId": "admin",
            "cardSurfaceFamily": "statusTimeline",
            "bindingKind": "summary"
          }
        ],
        "instanceDataSchema": {
          "scopeLabel": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "searchable": true, "labelTemplate": "{value}", "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "recordTypes": {
            "type": "text", "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "category", "labelTemplate": "Records: {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "rangeStart": {
            "type": "date", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "sortable": true, "displayIcon": "date_range", "labelTemplate": "From {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "rangeEnd": {
            "type": "date", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "event_repeat", "labelTemplate": "To {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "redactionProfile": {
            "type": "text", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "visibility_off", "labelTemplate": "Redaction: {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "requestedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId", "required": true, "writableBy": "formEntry", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "person_outline", "labelTemplate": "Requested by {value}",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "redactionPreviewedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "preview", "labelTemplate": "Redaction reviewed {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "redactionPreviewedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "generatedAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline", "sortable": true,
            "displayIcon": "download_done", "labelTemplate": "Generated {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["tile", "detail"]
          },
          "generatedByPersonaId": {
            "type": "personaId?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": []
          },
          "cancelledAt": {
            "type": "date?", "writableBy": "effect", "storage": "inline",
            "displayIcon": "block", "labelTemplate": "Cancelled {value}",
            "hideWhenEmpty": true, "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },

          "coversDays": {
            "type": "number", "formula": "daysBetween(rangeStart, rangeEnd)",
            "displayIcon": "timeline", "labelTemplate": "{value} days covered",
            "displayContexts": ["detail"]
          },
          "isRedactionReviewed": {
            "type": "bool", "formula": "if(redactionPreviewedAt == null, false, true)",
            "displayContexts": []
          }
        }
      }
    },

